      "content": "Given the description—a man in a dark hoodie walking slowly at night and looking at house numbers—it falls into a gray area requiring context. This behavior can suggest casing the property, which is a potential concern, but it could also be someone simply looking up addresses, such as a delivery driver or utility worker. The homeowner should be advised to monitor the situation, noting if the person lingers, approaches the house, or seems overly focused on the entry points.",
